{"version":1,"content":"<p>搜索巨頭承認，其「人工智能模式」正在衝擊傳統搜索業務；營收和利潤均低於市場預期。谷歌大幅增加人工智能支出，第三季度相關資本開支超過500億美元，導致現金流出規模創下紀錄。與此同時，核心搜索廣告業務表現疲軟，引發投資者擔憂，谷歌股價隨之大幅下跌。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584276.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.965350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:38:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"6613b9a7c47fbe57b8676e546002a7c9df110633ee3830d406f74633d51f33ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}